    "enUS": {
      "description": "You got de spears, now ya gonna learn how to throw dem.\r\n\r\nDe Riverglades be full o' crocolisks. Nasty tings. Snap you up if ya ain't quick. Perfect for target practice, heheh.\r\n\r\nGo stick yourself a bunch of dem. Den you come back to ol' Tran'jani for ya prize. If ya can stick a crocolisk, ya can stick any'ting.",
